{start_of_verse: Verse 6}
To better match the original single and 'Bookends'
album track, use a chromatic tuner and tune all the
strings up slightly sharp by approx. +25 cents.
Live versions are more likely to be in standard pitch
(Will then sound in the recorded key of A)
Both the [G/F#]and the [Em/F#]are intended to be
played as just passing bass notes only.
I would recommend using the voicings in the text
column numbers below.
